# --- source data --------------------------------------------------------
# ~66MB of parquet and GeoJSON that belongs to its publishers, not to us.
# Regenerate with `just pull` (needs TRAVEL_INSIGHTS_KEY in .env; ~5 min).
#
# The app does NOT read any of this at runtime — it reads only the derived
# artefacts in team8/poc_1/web/public/data, which ARE committed. What a fresh
# clone loses without a re-pull is the marimo notebook and the ability to
# re-run the pipeline. The demo itself works from the clone.
data/raw/
data/derived/

# --- generated reports --------------------------------------------------
# ~55MB of self-contained profile HTML. Regenerate with `just profile`.
docs/profiles/

